# Read by BuildKit for `docker build -f api/Dockerfile .` (a plain api/.dockerignore is ignored when the context is the repo root).
# Keeps the Foundry tree, node_modules and secrets out of the build context; the Dockerfile only COPYs api/, web/ and deployments/.
*
!api/package.json
!api/package-lock.json
!api/src
!deployments
!web
web/node_modules
web/screenshots
**/.env
**/.env.*
